---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Qaraye Marchants collects, uses, and protects your data.">
  <div class="container" style="padding: 60px 24px; max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 style="font-family: var(--display); font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink);">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 40px;">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <div style="color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you use Qaraye Marchants, we collect your account information (phone, email, business name, profile photo), listing information (products, descriptions, prices, images, videos), usage data (pages visited, products viewed), and device information (browser type, IP address).</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to provide and improve the marketplace, connect buyers with verified merchants, prevent fraud, send transactional emails, and analyze usage patterns.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">3. Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with service providers who help us operate the platform, law enforcement when legally required, and other users as needed to facilitate transactions.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">4. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and similar technologies to keep you signed in, remember your preferences, and understand how the site is used. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">5. Third-Party Advertising</h2>
      <p>We may display advertising through Google AdSense and other partners. These providers may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits. You can opt out of personalized advertising at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" style="color: var(--cyan);">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">6. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We use industry-standard measures to protect your data, including encrypted connections (HTTPS), secure password hashing, and access controls.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You can access, update, or delete your account information at any time from your profile page. To request full data deletion, contact <a href="mailto:support@qarayemarchants.com.ng" style="color: var(--cyan);">support@qarayemarchants.com.ng</a>.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Qaraye Marchants is not intended for users under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be announced on the site. Continued use after changes means you accept the updated policy.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px;">10. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:support@qarayemarchants.com.ng" style="color: var(--cyan);">support@qarayemarchants.com.ng</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>